WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
ToolSpace: Scaling Tool-Centric Environment Synthesis for Long-Horizon Agents.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Real tools. Cross-service workflows.
Data, state, and retry dependencies.

00:08.000 --> 00:25.000
Follow state-compatible edges. Checkpoint before execution.
On failure: restore the checkpoint and resample the next tool.

00:25.000 --> 00:27.000
Replay from the initial state.
Keep the task only when every assertion passes.

00:27.000 --> 00:35.000
Ground the graph. Execute the walk. Verify the task.
77,760 graph nodes. 804 environments. 34,376 SFT samples.

00:35.000 --> 00:42.000
All seven benchmarks: AutomationBench, SkillsBench, JobBench,
Tau3-Banking, BFCL-V4, Harvey-LAB, OfficeQA-Pro.
8B with agent RL: 7.2 to 20.7 average.

00:42.000 --> 00:49.000
35B-A3B with agent RL: 23.0 to 43.2 average.
Full per-benchmark results from Table 1.

00:49.000 --> 00:56.000
744B-A40B with SFT: 44.6 to 56.6 average.
Matches Claude Opus 5's average in Table 1.

00:56.000 --> 01:00.000
